      "message": "This patch introduces a speed feature `bias_obmc_mode_rd_scale_pct` to increase the rd cost of obmc motion mode to bias the encoder decisions against obmc motion mode.\n\nWe conducted visual testing on the worst-case quality-drop contents for the following comparisons:\n  - LC0 vs (LC1 + this change) \n  - LC1 vs (LC1 + this change)\n\nIn some cases, reviewers observed that the modified content appeared better, while in others the reference content was preferred. Overall, the visual quality of the modified and reference contents appears to be comparable, with no consistent degradation observed.\n\nPerformance results of encoder and decoder for the streams generated with low complexity decode enabled.\n\n```\n                  Instruction Count\n                      Reduction(%)                       BD-Rate Loss(%)              Time Reduction(%)\ncpu  Resolution    Encoder    Decoder   avg.psnr  ovr.psnr   ssim     vmaf   vmaf_neg dav1d Decoder\n 1         608P    -0.441     0.999     -0.0060   -0.0029  -0.0306  -0.0649   -0.0733      1.032\n 1         720P    -0.373     0.812     -0.0572   -0.0255  -0.0304  -0.1462   -0.1166      0.832\n 1        1080P    -0.303     0.835     -0.0353   -0.0567  -0.0741  -0.1661   -0.1301      0.805\n 1      Average    -0.372     0.882     -0.0328   -0.0284  -0.0451  -0.1258   -0.1067      0.890\n\n 2         608P     0.343     1.349     -0.0497   -0.0338  -0.0845  -0.2354   -0.1938      1.314\n 2         720P     0.607     1.171      0.0014    0.0140  -0.0189  -0.1676   -0.1410      1.122\n 2        1080P     0.426     1.021      0.0140    0.0247   0.0167  -0.1074   -0.0803      1.343\n 2      Average     0.459     1.180     -0.0114    0.0016  -0.0289  -0.1701   -0.1384      1.260\n\n 3         608P     0.269     1.613     -0.0474   -0.0895  -0.0790  -0.3765   -0.3052      1.448\n 3         720P     0.590     1.613     -0.0164   -0.0235  -0.0253  -0.3036   -0.2485      1.412\n 3        1080P     0.466     1.579      0.0185   -0.0317   0.0091  -0.2348   -0.1665      1.387\n 3      Average     0.442     1.602     -0.0151   -0.0482  -0.0317  -0.3050   -0.2401      1.416\n```\n\nThe instruction count reduction specified has been measured using the command:\n```\n$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc …\n$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./dav1d --cpumask avx2 …\n```\nThe decode time is measured using command\n```\ntime taskset -c 0  ./dav1d  --cpumask avx2 …\n```",
